          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 286305,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "I've just finished my review. The templates are solid, but I've added two suggestions in A2: 1) A specific addendum for a pet policy to avoid future disputes. 2) A clearer clause on how Common Area Maintenance (CAM) charges are calculated for commercial tenants.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "👀",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 349749,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "Excellent points, especially on the CAM charges. That needs to be ironclad. Once these are finalized, the key terms must be easily reportable for our owner updates. I'm thinking of the data we'll need for A8.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 518065,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "Great feedback. I agree with both suggestions. I'll accept the changes and incorporate them into the main templates.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 526084,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "The templates look fine to me.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M24",
            "speaker_id": 316072,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "This brings up the topic of rent collection for T8. How are we planning to handle payments?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M25",
            "speaker_id": 349749,
            "reply_to": "M24",
            "text": "Let's decide that now. To streamline operations, I propose we use an online payment portal as the primary method. Bank transfers can be a secondary option. Rent due on the 1st of the month.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M26",
            "speaker_id": 286305,
            "reply_to": "M25",
            "text": "I support that. An online portal is standard now and greatly reduces manual tracking. We can automate reminders for late payments.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M27",
            "speaker_id": 518065,
            "reply_to": "M25",
            "text": "What about an escalation process for arrears?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M28",
            "speaker_id": 349749,
            "reply_to": "M27",
            "text": "My proposal: automated reminder on the 5th, a personal call/email on the 10th, and a formal notice of breach on the 15th if unpaid. We can document this as our standard procedure.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "👍",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M29",
            "speaker_id": 518065,
            "reply_to": "M28",
            "text": "That's a clear and fair process. I'm on board.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M30",
            "speaker_id": 316072,
            "reply_to": "M28",
            "text": "Okay, I understand the process.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M31",
            "speaker_id": 349749,
            "reply_to": "M28",
            "text": "Excellent. Let's formalize this. We agree on the rent collection methods, due dates, and the arrears escalation steps as discussed.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
