            "speaker_id": 286305,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "Of course. I've added a budget column to the marketing outline. I suggest we start with online property portals and targeted social media ads, as they offer the best measurability and ROI. We can set a clear rule: if a lead source doesn't convert within 2 weeks, we reallocate the budget.",
